         * follows (rhs values are in pixels):
         *
         *       x1 = X / W *1024
         *       y1 = Y / H *256
         *       x2 = (X-1) / W *1024
         *       y2 = (Y-1) / H *256
         *
         *       Where:  X is distance from the left side of the underlying cell
         *               Y is distance from the top of the underlying cell
