     * Class and Function List:
     * Function list:
     * - __construct()
     * - getErrorFormatted()
     * - getErrno()
     * - __construct()
     * - GetRequestArguments()
     * - Open()
     * - SendRequest()
     * - ReadReplyHeaders()
     * - ReadReplyBody()
     * - Close()
     * - _StreamRequest()
     * - _ReadReply()
     * - _ReadStream()
     * - _BuildDigest()
     * Classes list:
     * - httpException extends Exception
     * - http_class
     */
