         *
         * vCard 3.0 says:
         *   * (rfc2425) Backslashes, newlines (\n or \N) and comma's must be
         *     escaped, all time time.
         *   * Comma's are used for delimiters in multiple values
         *   * (rfc2426) Adds to to this that the semi-colon MUST also be escaped,
