     *                                                                  'MU'=Round to Max unit price (MAIN_MAX_DECIMALS_UNIT)
     *                                                                  'MT'=Round to Max for totals with Tax (MAIN_MAX_DECIMALS_TOT)
     *                                                                  'MS'=Round to Max for stock quantity (MAIN_MAX_DECIMALS_STOCK)
