     *											- '0' if ($rounding is defined):                 price2num('W9ç', 'MT', 0) => '9',  price2num('W9ç', 'MT', 1) => '0',   price2num('W9ç', 'MT', 2) => '9'
     *											Note: The best way to guarantee a numeric value is to add a cast (float) before the price2num().
